d on the test and the code's own description for the expected behaviour.\n- This changes results for amounts ending in exactly half a cent: for example, 2.665 now rounds to 2.66 instead of 2.67. Any downstream code that relied on the old rounding will see different values.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files and the advisory.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VgtVEYP3hjkQJp4kGieQvR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Arm2zRWCzeHRUwpqDgJnGb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QdPbKKmKREgFcNGeg8uAtW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212", "confidence": 0.8}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is clear: switch `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Creating a branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XGT3w8yFxmKHU788oabknd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ChXUa3S6xMwqRvhQaDC1pR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.0